Package: micropoint
Type: Package
Title: Below or within canopy point microclimate modelling with R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ilya", "Maclean", email = "i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk", role = "cre"))
Maintainer: Ilya M. D. Maclean <i.m.d.maclean@exeter.ac.uk>
Description: Mechanistic modelling of microclimate at a point location. Uses standard
    hourly weather data and vegetation and soil properties to simulate temperature, humidity,
    wind speed, radiation and soil moisture above, within and below vegetation canopies,
    as well as soil temperature and moisture below ground. Also models ectotherm body
    temperatures under the simulated microclimatic conditions.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
