    stats,
    Rcpp
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/ilyamaclean/micropoint
BugReports: https://github.com/ilyamaclean/micropoint/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
